# The SETUP and CONFIG screens are Mission Planner's backstage views: the list its Load handler
# builds down the left, and the page chosen from it on the right, one at a time.
#
# GCSViews/InitialSetup.cs:155-395 adds each page under the condition around its call - most need
# a vehicle whose every parameter is in - under the headings Mandatory Hardware, Optional Hardware
# and Advanced, and opens on nothing the first time. ExtLibs/Controls/BackstageView/BackstageView.cs
# draws a heading as ">> title", its pages only while it is open (choosing it opens or closes it),
# and on a choice deactivates the old page and activates the new. Leaving the screen remembers the
# page showing (lastpagename) and the screen opens on it again. GCSViews/SoftwareConfig.cs:142-316
# builds CONFIG's list, headingless, and opens on its `start` page when nothing is remembered.
#
# The list checked here is a copter of 3.5 or later with every parameter in; the unit tests in
# crates/mp-gui/src/setup.rs build the same list from the same conditions and check this file's
# `expect setup.pages` line against it.
#
# Needs SITL copter on tcp:127.0.0.1:5760 started from tools/sitl/params/copter.parm. Run as
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/setup-list.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

screen setup
window 1600x1200
budget 39
# A first budget, set by hand until a passing run records one.
# A config.xml of its own, so the "Show me again?" boxes this script clicks are not already
# suppressed by the settings of the machine running it.
env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml

# The Loading page (ConfigParamLoading, listed while parameters are still coming, with its
# Retry Now) is not driven here: SITL streams its 1,408 parameters over TCP in under a second,
# before this window is up, so the page is gone before a click could reach it - MP_NO_MAVFTP
# scaffolding to force the classic stream made no difference (2026-09-26). Its listing and its
# leaving are the unit tests' (crates/mp-gui/src/setup.rs, while_parameters_arrive_the_lists_
# offer_the_loading_page). The vehicle first: a click before its first heartbeat is a click the
# screen may forget (vehicle.connected only says the link is open).
expect screen setup
expect vehicle.count > 0
expect params.held > 1000
expect setup.page none
expect setup.pages ConfigFirmwareDisabled,ConfigMandatory,ConfigFrameClassType,ConfigAccelerometerCalibration,ConfigHWCompass2,ConfigRadioInput,ConfigRadioOutput,ConfigSerial,ConfigESCCalibration,ConfigFlightModes,ConfigFailSafe,ConfigInitialParams,ConfigHWIDs,ConfigADSB,ConfigOptional,ConfigSerialInjectGPS,ConfigCubeID,Sikradio,ConfigGPSOrder,ConfigBatteryMonitoring,ConfigBatteryMonitoring2,ConfigDroneCAN,JoystickSetup,ConfigCompassMot,ConfigHWRangeFinder,ConfigHWAirspeed,ConfigHWPX4Flow,ConfigHWOptFlow,ConfigHWOSD,ConfigMount,ConfigMotorTest,ConfigHWBT,ConfigHWParachute,ConfigHWESP8266,TrackerUI,ConfigFFT,ConfigAdvanced,ConfigTerminal,ConfigREPL
expect setup.titles Install Firmware,Mandatory Hardware,Frame Type,Accel Calibration,Compass,Radio Calibration,Servo Output,Serial Ports,ESC Calibration,Flight Modes,FailSafe,Initial Tune Parameter,HW ID,ADSB,Optional Hardware,RTK/GPS Inject,CubeID Update,Sik Radio,CAN GPS Order,Battery Monitor,Battery Monitor 2,DroneCAN/UAVCAN,Joystick,Compass/Motor Calib,Range Finder,Airspeed,PX4Flow,Optical Flow,OSD,Camera Gimbal,Motor Test,Bluetooth Setup,Parachute,ESP8266 Setup,Antenna Tracker,FFT Setup,Advanced,Terminal,Script REPL
expect setup.groups Mandatory Hardware=ConfigFrameClassType,ConfigAccelerometerCalibration,ConfigHWCompass2,ConfigRadioInput,ConfigRadioOutput,ConfigSerial,ConfigESCCalibration,ConfigFlightModes,ConfigFailSafe,ConfigInitialParams,ConfigHWIDs,ConfigADSB;Optional Hardware=ConfigSerialInjectGPS,ConfigCubeID,Sikradio,ConfigGPSOrder,ConfigBatteryMonitoring,ConfigBatteryMonitoring2,ConfigDroneCAN,JoystickSetup,ConfigCompassMot,ConfigHWRangeFinder,ConfigHWAirspeed,ConfigHWPX4Flow,ConfigHWOptFlow,ConfigHWOSD,ConfigMount,ConfigMotorTest,ConfigHWBT,ConfigHWParachute,ConfigHWESP8266,TrackerUI,ConfigFFT;Advanced=ConfigTerminal,ConfigREPL
# Every heading closed.
expect setup.shown ConfigFirmwareDisabled,ConfigMandatory,ConfigOptional,ConfigAdvanced

click setup-page-ConfigFirmwareDisabled
expect setup.page ConfigFirmwareDisabled
expect setup.title Install Firmware

# Mandatory Hardware: choosing the heading opens it and shows its page.
click setup-page-ConfigMandatory
expect setup.page ConfigMandatory
expect setup.expanded ConfigMandatory
expect setup.shown ConfigFirmwareDisabled,ConfigMandatory,ConfigFrameClassType,ConfigAccelerometerCalibration,ConfigHWCompass2,ConfigRadioInput,ConfigRadioOutput,ConfigSerial,ConfigESCCalibration,ConfigFlightModes,ConfigFailSafe,ConfigInitialParams,ConfigHWIDs,ConfigADSB,ConfigOptional,ConfigAdvanced
click setup-page-ConfigFrameClassType
expect setup.page ConfigFrameClassType
click setup-page-ConfigAccelerometerCalibration
expect setup.page ConfigAccelerometerCalibration
click setup-page-ConfigHWCompass2
expect setup.page ConfigHWCompass2
click setup-page-ConfigRadioInput
expect setup.page ConfigRadioInput
click setup-page-ConfigRadioOutput
expect setup.page ConfigRadioOutput
click setup-page-ConfigSerial
expect setup.page ConfigSerial
# The page drawn before the next click: on Windows a click in its first frames was lost one run in
# three (2026-09-26, NOT_DONE_YET_MATRIX.md), as a person would not click there.
expect config.serial.active true
expect config.serial.rows > 0
click setup-page-ConfigESCCalibration
expect setup.page ConfigESCCalibration

# The two ported pages that keep state are activated when chosen and deactivated when left.
click setup-page-ConfigFlightModes
expect setup.page ConfigFlightModes
expect config.flightmodes.active true
expect config.flightmodes.1 7
click setup-page-ConfigFailSafe
expect setup.page ConfigFailSafe
expect config.flightmodes.active false
expect config.failsafe.open true
expect config.failsafe.message Ensure your props are not on the Plane/Quad
click failsafe-message-ok
expect config.failsafe.message none
click setup-page-ConfigInitialParams
expect setup.page ConfigInitialParams
expect config.failsafe.open false
click setup-page-ConfigHWIDs
expect setup.page ConfigHWIDs
click setup-page-ConfigADSB
expect setup.page ConfigADSB

# Choosing the heading again closes it, and shows its page.
click setup-page-ConfigMandatory
expect setup.page ConfigMandatory
expect setup.shown ConfigFirmwareDisabled,ConfigMandatory,ConfigOptional,ConfigAdvanced

# Optional Hardware.
click setup-page-ConfigOptional
expect setup.page ConfigOptional
expect setup.expanded ConfigOptional
click setup-page-ConfigSerialInjectGPS
expect setup.page ConfigSerialInjectGPS
click setup-page-ConfigCubeID
expect setup.page ConfigCubeID
click setup-page-Sikradio
expect setup.page Sikradio
click setup-page-ConfigGPSOrder
expect setup.page ConfigGPSOrder
click setup-page-ConfigBatteryMonitoring
expect setup.page ConfigBatteryMonitoring
click setup-page-ConfigBatteryMonitoring2
expect setup.page ConfigBatteryMonitoring2
click setup-page-ConfigDroneCAN
expect setup.page ConfigDroneCAN
click setup-page-JoystickSetup
expect setup.page JoystickSetup
click setup-page-ConfigCompassMot
expect setup.page ConfigCompassMot
click setup-page-ConfigHWRangeFinder
expect setup.page ConfigHWRangeFinder
click setup-page-ConfigHWAirspeed
expect setup.page ConfigHWAirspeed
click setup-page-ConfigHWPX4Flow
expect setup.page ConfigHWPX4Flow
click setup-page-ConfigHWOptFlow
expect setup.page ConfigHWOptFlow
click setup-page-ConfigHWOSD
expect setup.page ConfigHWOSD
click setup-page-ConfigMount
expect setup.page ConfigMount
click setup-page-ConfigMotorTest
expect setup.page ConfigMotorTest
click setup-page-ConfigHWBT
expect setup.page ConfigHWBT
click setup-page-ConfigHWParachute
expect setup.page ConfigHWParachute
click setup-page-ConfigHWESP8266
expect setup.page ConfigHWESP8266
click setup-page-TrackerUI
expect setup.page TrackerUI
click setup-page-ConfigFFT
expect setup.page ConfigFFT
click setup-page-ConfigOptional
expect setup.shown ConfigFirmwareDisabled,ConfigMandatory,ConfigOptional,ConfigAdvanced

# Advanced.
click setup-page-ConfigAdvanced
expect setup.page ConfigAdvanced
click setup-page-ConfigTerminal
expect setup.page ConfigTerminal
click setup-page-ConfigREPL
expect setup.page ConfigREPL

# Leave on Flight Modes.
click setup-page-ConfigAdvanced
click setup-page-ConfigMandatory
click setup-page-ConfigFlightModes
expect setup.page ConfigFlightModes
expect config.flightmodes.active true

# CONFIG, beside SETUP: leaving SETUP deactivates its page; CONFIG opens on Basic Tuning, its
# `start` for a copter.
click tab-config
expect screen config
expect config.flightmodes.active false
expect config.page ConfigSimplePids
expect config.title Basic Tuning
expect config.pages ~ ConfigAC_Fence,ConfigSimplePids,ConfigArducopter,
expect config.pages ~ ConfigUserDefined,ConfigRawParams,ConfigPlanner
click config-page-ConfigRawParams
expect config.page ConfigRawParams
expect config.title Full Parameter List
# RawParamWarning, on the Full Parameter List's Activate (ConfigRawParams.cs:92): "Show me
# again?" unticked, so no later visit asks, and OK.
click raw-param-warning-again
click raw-param-warning-ok
click config-page-ConfigAC_Fence
expect config.page ConfigAC_Fence
click config-page-ConfigArducopter
expect config.page ConfigArducopter
click config-page-ConfigUserDefined
expect config.page ConfigUserDefined
click config-page-ConfigPlanner
expect config.page ConfigPlanner
click config-page-ConfigRawParams
expect config.page ConfigRawParams

# Back to SETUP: it opens on the page it was left on (lastpagename), which is activated again, and
# choosing a page under a closed heading opens the heading.
click tab-setup
expect setup.page ConfigFlightModes
expect setup.expanded ConfigMandatory
expect config.flightmodes.active true

# And CONFIG opens on its remembered page rather than on `start`.
click tab-config
expect config.page ConfigRawParams
